The film summarises the plot of the TV series *La casa de papel* (Money Heist, Parts 1–2). Sources for the facts: `research/FACTS.md`.
No footage, stills, music, logos, masks or actors' likenesses from the series are used: the robbers are generic figures in plain red jumpsuits,
the Mint is a generic neoclassical building, the banknotes are a made-up design. The show's name, characters' code names and plot belong to their owners;
